# Project Standards

## Stack

- Java 21, Spring Boot, Maven, PostgreSQL
- React + TypeScript frontend

## Architecture

- Follow Clean Architecture.
- Domain must not depend on Spring, JPA, HTTP, or external API classes.
- Use constructor injection only (no field/`@Autowired` injection).

## API & DTOs

- Never return JPA entities from controllers; map to request/response DTOs.
- Prefer Java `record` types for immutable DTOs when practical.
- Add Jakarta Bean Validation annotations to every write request DTO.
- Return RFC-style structured error responses via one global exception handler.

## Caching

- Cache read-only PokéAPI responses with Caffeine.
- TTL: 10 minutes.

## Testing

- Use TDD: write a failing unit test before production code for each use case.
- Every public endpoint must have tests.

## Security & Hygiene

- Never log passwords, JWTs, or sensitive configuration values.
- Keep commits small and focused.
- Do not generate unused files or placeholder TODO implementations.
